The add-ons obtain it at build time, either from Nous Research's own published
Docker image (nousresearch/hermes-agent) or by fetching a pinned upstream git
commit and installing it. Hermes Agent remains under its own MIT license, which
travels with it; the copyright above applies to the packaging in this repository
and nothing else.

